      "message": "Done\nNo it doesn\u0027t. The started condition is only for \u0027transmit\u0027 substate or \u0027receive\u0027 substate. LM4 spec requires the MCS_START bit to be set when change direction. Comment added in \u0027started\u0027 flag.",
